    "chunk_text": "ofermetto astigen, \u00fe\u00e6t he bead \u00fe\u00e6t And he bebead \u00fe\u00e6t mon Iohannes \u00feone apostol gebrohte on Bothmose \u00fe\u00e6m iglande, on wr\u00e6csi\u00fee & he bebead \u00fe\u00e6t mon acwealde eall Dauides cynn, to \u00feon, gif Crist geboren n\u00e6re \u00fea giet, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m bebode he wear\u00f0 self unweor\u00f0lice ofslagen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s VIII hund wintra & XLVI, \u00fea feng Nerfa to Romana \u00dea gespr\u00e6con hie him betweonum \u00fe\u00e6t hie wolden anwendan ealle \u00fea gesetnessa & ealle \u00fea \u00dea gefor Nerfa, & Traianus h\u00e6fde \u00feone anwald XIX ger \u00e6fter him. & he under\u00feiedde Romanum eall \u00fea folc \u00fee him niwlice geswicen h\u00e6fdon. & he bebead his aldormonnum \u00fe\u00e6t hie w\u00e6ren cristenra monna ehtend. \u00dea s\u00e6de him hiora an, Plenius w\u00e6s haten, \u00fe\u00e6t he woh bude, & miclum on \u00fe\u00e6m syngade. He hit \u00fea hr\u00e6dlice eft forbead. On \u00fe\u00e6re tide w\u00e6ron Iudan on miclum geflite & on micelre unsibbe wi\u00f0 \u00fea londleode \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r hie On \u00fe\u00e6re tide Traianus gefor on utsihte on Seleutia \u00fe\u00e6re byrig. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s DCCC wintra & LXVII, feng Adrianus to Romana & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee him cristne bec cu\u00fee w\u00e6ron \u00feurh \u00e6nne \u00feara apostola geongrena, Quadratus w\u00e6s He wear\u00f0 \u00fea Romanum swa leof, & swa weor\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hie hiene nanuht ne",
